"pages are structured in a way search engines can understand. Titles, "
"headings, and page layout are set up correctly from the start. This helps "
"your website appear more clearly in search results over time."
msgstr ""
"Dieser Plan kombiniert eine Multi-Page-Website mit einer soliden SEO-"
